#: prefs.js:476
msgid ""
"<b>Disclaimer</b>\n"
"Optical Character Recognition (OCR) and smart data extraction are inherently "
"imperfect. Results from this extension may be inaccurate, incomplete, "
"incorrectly formatted, or affected by screen artifacts and misrecognized "
"text. Always verify critical information, such as financial numbers, "
"addresses, names, dates, and other sensitive data, manually. The author is "
"not responsible for any consequences resulting from the use of incorrect or "
"incomplete data extracted by this tool. Use this extension at your own risk."
msgstr ""

